\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  What marvelous love is this?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Love that is clean and pure.
\par Thou ordered holy marriage,
\par Which foundation is love.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par One day Thou went to Canan
\par Wedding ceremony;
\par Thou went there with Thy blessing,
\par Do bless this couple too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. With reference to this couple,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thou have united them.
\par Do bless them and their marriage,
\par So to become their friends
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj What Thou caused to happen someday,
\par Let it dawn this day too.
\par Bless both the man and his wife,
\par Their household to be blessed
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Come, sow Thy good news also,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 in the hearts of them all,
\par let it sprout and get mature,
\par in Thy great Holy Name.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let them bear plenteous good fruits,
\par in glory of Thy Name.
\par Cleanse their lifestyle forever,
\par even as Thou are pure.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. Oh, let Thy kingdom descend
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 and fill their hearts always;
\par fill them also with Thy love,
\par and let them grow with it.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Suffer them to use Thy glory,
\par as their great objective.
\par Teach them how to speak the Truth
\par till death make them depart.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. Jesus, Thou being Prince of Peace;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Thou art the source of peace.
\par  Cause them to be dynamic,
\par in times of all troubles.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Do bless all their descendants,
\par and let it end them well.
\par Let them see Thee face to face,
\par \pard      In Thy heav'nly Kingdom.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

